
  spoon - find useful forks

  Repository: > owner/repo_

  [ctrl+c] Quit [Enter] Search repository [Esc] Return to fork table [left/ctrl+b] Move input cursor left
[right/ctrl+f] Move input cursor right [home/ctrl+a] Move input cursor to start [end/ctrl+e] Move input cursor to end
[backspace] Delete previous character [delete] Delete next character [ctrl+u] Clear input
